      "aggregation_provenance": "Fire radiative power sizes the fire the Freitas plume sees (GSL module_smoke_plumerise.F90 burnt area = 0.7/1.3 * 0.0006 * FRP), so every model cell a RAVE pixel reaches gets the pixel's whole FRP (gpuwm.obs_regrid_bridge.SUM_AGGREGATIONS 'touch'); a 1/n^2 share would turn one 3 km fire into n^2 small fires on a finer grid and lower every plume. The emitted MASS rows stay 'partition'.",
