  "provenance": "Checked 2025-01-08 06Z source file on 2026-09-30. PM25 is a direct extensive-mass choice, not the RRFS-SD FRE-derived smoke recipe. Public preprocessing https://github.com/ufs-community/ufs-srweather-app/blob/2ad2bc5731819cdc5aef95372a8b27ffe417bf40/ush/smoke_dust/core/regrid/processor.py#L204-L224 excludes QA < 2 only in HIGH mode and does not mask Prediction_Flag. This row selects HIGH, retains predicted detections, and interprets the -1 no-retrieval sentinel as zero emissions, matching its FRP normalization. Creation lag is measured from hour start over 2025-01-08 00Z through 11Z; posting can be later."
